Well, Orcus always has a wand of death. I was rather surprised in my most
recent game when I went into the Quest that 2 of the centaurs in the hedge
maze had them. Thank god I had a cloak of magic resistance, or I would have
been severely boned. You can actually be pretty thankful for the relative
scarcity of /oD, because I've never in any game found one that wasn't going
to be used on me before I killed its owner.

>Do I have to polypile? 

